# Rigid bodies of ellipsoidal particles -- exercises the extended (ELLIPSOID)
# path of fix rigid/small/kk: each particle's space-frame quaternion and angmom
# are recomputed from the body orientation in set_xv on the device (the bonus
# quat is reached through the ellipsoid atom-vec).  erotate/asphere reflects the
# per-particle angmom that the kernel sets.
#   lmp -in in.rigid.ellipsoids
#   lmp -k on -sf kk -in in.rigid.ellipsoids

